        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 style="margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);">🏠 Provider Low-Income Plans</h4>
          <p style="font-size:var(--text-sm);color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.7;">Spectrum Internet Assist ($17.99/mo), AT&T Access ($5–10/mo), and similar programs. <a href="/low-income-internet">Check eligibility</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 style="margin-bottom:var(--space-xs);">🏫 Community WiFi</h4>
          <p style="font-size:var(--text-sm);color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.7;">Libraries, community centers, and municipal WiFi programs across {stateData.name} offer free access.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:var(--space-lg);text-align:center;">
        <a href="/cheap-internet" class="btn btn-primary">View All Cheap Internet Options →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
